	(text "Base board for the Waveshare ESP32-P4-ETH / -POE-ETH: the module plugs in from above (header P1, Pico layout,\nrows 17.78 mm apart). J1 = P4 pins 1-20, J7 = P4 pins 21-40. +5V = VSYS (P4 pin 39). The PoE module sits on top of the P4.\nAll parts through-hole. ESPHome: buttons GPIO22/20/21/23 INPUT_PULLUP, inverted (pressed = low); LEDs GPIO32/33/4/5 via LEDC (PWM).\nButton connectors (JST-XH): 1 = LED+ (+5V), 2 = LED-, 3 = switch (NO), 4 = GND (switch C).\nR13-R16: fit 0R, or a resistor once the ring current at 5 V is measured."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 12.7 195.58 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "ef43e2d6-9e1c-414d-87b2-4d74973b1c0b")
	)
